**voyage provider example:**

```json
{
  "embedding": {
    "dense": {
      "provider": "voyage",
      "api_key": "pa-xxx",
      "api_base": "https://api.voyageai.com/v1",
      "model": "voyage-4-lite",
      "dimension": 1024
    }
